# Pairs with TypeOK. A model-domain defect: the budget leaves 0..MaxWrites.
MODULE: ArrivalOverdrawsBudget
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an arrival consumes two writes, driving the write budget below zero
PERTURBS: ArriveRule

--- FIND
    /\ budget' = budget - 1
    /\ obs' = NoObs
--- REPLACE
    /\ budget' = budget - 2
    /\ obs' = NoObs
--- END
